      "label": "Icon list — covers design-brief items “Benefit lists” and “Icon lists” as one component: the docx names both once each with no further elaboration distinguishing them, and both are structurally an icon (or none) + short label repeating row. If the business later wants a visually distinct short-statement-only benefit list (no icons) vs. a denser icon-only checklist, split this into two — flagging that ambiguity rather than guessing a split that might not match what's wanted. Icon set stays on ionicons (“ion-ios-*”) to match every other icon usage already in this pack (01-header.json, 06-faq.json, 07-footer-mobile-actions.json), not the design brief's “similar to Lucide” suggestion — switching icon libraries mid-pack would be a bigger, uglier inconsistency than the brief's stylistic preference is worth."
